    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25394" root="ضأ" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَأْضَآءٌ</span></b> , [in the CK <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الضَأْضَأُ</span> is erroneously put
for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الضَّأْضَأءُ</span>,] as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَوْضَآءٌ</span></b>  (O, K, TA) and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَوْضًى</span>, (CK,) [which belong to art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضو</span> and the
last of which is mentioned in the K in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضوض</span>,]
The <i>voices, cries,</i> or <i>shouts, of men,</i> (AA, O, K,
TA,) <i>in war,</i> * or <i>fight.</i> (O, K, TA.)

